.TH DCR-GEN 1 "2026-08-04" "dcr 0.8.4" "DCR Manual"
.SH NAME
dcr-gen \- Generate IDE and tooling integration files
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dcr gen \fI<subcommand>\fR
[\fB\-\-debug\fR | \fB\-\-release\fR]
[\fB\-\-quiet\fR | \fB\-q\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generates IDE and tooling integration files for DCR projects.
Machine-readable build facts are written under
.B .dcr/
(compile database, build-info, toolchain).
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
.B project-info
Print project metadata as JSON to stdout (absolute paths, artifact_path, target_dir).
Also updates
.B .dcr/build-info.json
and
.B .dcr/toolchain.json .
.TP
.B compile-commands
Generate
.B .dcr/compile_commands.json
(atomic write) and ensure
.B .clangd
points at
.B .dcr
as CompilationDatabase.
.TP
.B vscode
Generate
.B .vscode/
integration files (tasks, launch configurations) and compile commands under
.B .dcr/ .
.TP
.B clion
Generate
.B .idea/
integration files for CLion and compile commands under
.B .dcr/ .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Use debug profile (default).
.TP
.B \-\-release
Use release profile.
.TP
.B \-\-quiet\fR, \fB\-q
Suppress human-readable success messages on stdout.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B .dcr/compile_commands.json
JSON Compilation Database (moved from project root; breaking change in 0.8.4).
.TP
.B .dcr/build-info.json
Last known artifact path, profile, compiler.
.TP
.B .dcr/toolchain.json
Resolved compiler/debugger (and Qt tools if configured).
.TP
.B .clangd
Created once with CompilationDatabase: .dcr; not overwritten if customized.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dcr (1),
.BR dcr-build (1)
